<span id="S3.T2.4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T2.4.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Detailed Fact</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T2.4.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S3.T2.4.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:170.7pt;">
<span id="S3.T2.4.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T2.4.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">Paris Louvre Museum: The Louvre Museum is a world-famous art museum...</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T2.4.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T2.4.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb">
